[0.172,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[38;5;174m▝▜\u001b[48;5;16m█\u001b[7G█\u001b[49m█▀\u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;246mdeepseek-flash[\u001b[28Gm] · API Usage Billing\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m ▝▝   ▝▝ \u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;246m/work\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;246m❯ \u001b[38;5;231mPlease implement this issue.\u001b[39m                                                            \r\u001b[1B                              \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m#45 Count overdue days in business days\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m                                       \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231mAccounting counts how long an invoice is overdue in business days, and the aging report\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bshould too: weekends and public h\u001b[37Gliday\u001b[44Gdon't cou\u001b[54Gt. An invoice due on a Friday\u001b[84Gis 1 \u001b[39m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231mbusiness day overdue\u001b[24Go\u001b[26G the next Mon\u001b[42G.\u001b[39m                                              \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                        \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231mThe holidays change every year, so keep them in a JSON file that accounting can update \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bwithout touching the code. The list for\u001b[43G2026: 2026-01-01, 2026-01-19, 2026-02-16, \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m2026-05-25, 2026-06-19, 2026-07-03,\u001b[39G2026-\u001b[45G9-07, \u001b[52G026-1\u001b[58G-12, \u001b[64G026-1\u001b[70G-11, \u001b[76G026-1\u001b[82G-26, \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B12\u001b[13G.\u001b[39m                                                                         \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B           \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231mThe accountant runs invoicer from the package (see the README), so it has to work \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bt\u001b[6Gre.\u001b[39m                                                                            \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246mThought for \u001b[1m1s\u001b[22m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'll\u001b[8Gstart\u001b[14Gby\u001b[17Gexploring\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Gcodebase\u001b[40Gto\u001b[43Gunderstand\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58Gstructure.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mReading\u001b[11Gpackage.json\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m ⎿  .gitignore\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m✶\u001b[3GWandering… \u001b[38;5;246m(34s · ↓\u001b[23G8.5k tokens · thought for 28s)\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Tip: Use /btw to ask\u001b[27Ga quick side question without interrupting Claude's current work\u001b[39m\u001b[34;1H\u001b[32;3H"]
